{"egress":"public","declaredCidrs":[{"cidr":"127.0.0.1/32","ports":[8080]}]}
declaredCidrs 127.0.0.1/32 overlaps the baseline exclusion 127.0.0.0/8, which the ruleset drops ahead of every accept

