{"egress":"public","declaredCidrs":[{"cidr":"100.100.0.0/16","ports":[443]}]}
declaredCidrs 100.100.0.0/16 overlaps the baseline exclusion 100.64.0.0/10, which the ruleset drops ahead of every accept

