{"egress":"public","declaredCidrs":[{"cidr":"192.0.2.0/30","ports":[443]}]}
declaredCidrs 192.0.2.0/30 overlaps the baseline exclusion 192.0.2.0/24, which the ruleset drops ahead of every accept

