{"egress":"public","declaredCidrs":[{"cidr":"224.0.0.1/32","ports":[443]}]}
declaredCidrs 224.0.0.1/32 overlaps the baseline exclusion 224.0.0.0/4, which the ruleset drops ahead of every accept

# declaredCidrs reserved
{"egress":"public","declaredCidrs":[{"cidr":"240.0.0.0/4","ports":[443]}]}
declaredCidrs 240.0.0.0/4 overlaps the baseline exclusion 240.0.0.0/4, which the ruleset drops ahead of every accept

# declaredCidrs the VMM's own bridge
{"egress":"public","declaredCidrs":[{"cidr":"10.89.0.0/24","ports":[443]}]}
declaredCidrs 10.89.0.0/24 overlaps the baseline exclusion 10.0.0.0/8, which the ruleset drops ahead of every accept

# declaredCidrs a VMM subnet on public space
{"egress":"public","declaredCidrs":[{"cidr":"172.104.9.0/24","ports":[443]}]}
declaredCidrs 172.104.9.0/24 overlaps the baseline exclusion 172.104.0.0/16, which the ruleset drops ahead of every accept

